# Build outputs
build/
# Side build trees, e.g. configuring without the vcpkg toolchain to prove the
# TRACE_WITH_FFMPEG / TRACE_WITH_AUDIO guards still compile with those absent.
build-*/
out/
cmake-build-*/

# CMake
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
Makefile
cmake_install.cmake
compile_commands.json

# OS/editor
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Stray measurement captures at the repo root. capture.ps1 defaults to
# `shot.png` in the working directory, so running it by hand from the checkout
# leaves a multi-megabyte PNG next to the source -- one was committed by
# accident during spec phase 14 and had to be taken back out of the history
# before it was pushed. A screenshot is measurement output, never a source file;
# the harness writes to $env:TEMP for everything else and these are what is left.
/shot.png
/*.png

# Claude Code local settings. settings.local.json holds a per-machine tool
# allowlist with absolute paths into this checkout and a scratchpad -- it is
# useful to whoever is sitting at this box and meaningless anywhere else.
# A shared .claude/settings.json would be committable; nothing here is.
.claude/

# Icon working files (superseded revisions, source zips). assets/icons/ itself
# was removed at spec phase 2 -- the 260807 package supersedes it -- but the
# untracked working files can still be sitting there on a machine.
assets/icons/

# Interface design working files (source zips). The tracked part of
# assets/Interface/ survives only for the two frame-step glyphs and leaves with
# them at spec phases 4-5.
assets/Interface/*.zip
assets/260807 Trace Media Player Icon/*.zip
